<view class="screen {{theme}}"><mm-header back="{{true}}" bindback="back"/><view class="content"><mm-state busy="{{busy}}" error="{{error}}" bindretry="retry"/><view class="eyebrow">TRAJECTORY / 持续观察</view><view class="title">一份变化中的自画像</view><view class="tabs"><button bindtap="window" data-days="30" class="{{days==='30'?'selected':''}}" disabled="{{busy}}">30天</button><button bindtap="window" data-days="90" class="{{days==='90'?'selected':''}}" disabled="{{busy}}">90天</button><button bindtap="window" data-days="all" class="{{days==='all'?'selected':''}}" disabled="{{busy}}">全部</button></view><block wx:if="{{result}}"><view wx:if="{{result.aesthetic.status!=='available'}}" class="card"><mm-chart kind="empty"/><view class="heading">已有 {{points.length}} / 3 次可比画像</view><view>至少三个同版本、同选择规则的观察，才能描述趋势。无需反复刷新制造重复记录。</view></view><view wx:else class="card"><view class="heading">相邻观察之间的变化</view><view class="muted">JSD表示距离；方向需查看具体标签份额。</view><view wx:for="{{facts}}" wx:key="index" class="rule"><view class="fact-label">{{item.label}}</view><view>{{item.value}}</view></view></view><view wx:for="{{points}}" wx:key="snapshotId" class="card" bindtap="go" data-url="/pages/evidence/index?snapshotId={{item.snapshotId}}">{{item.date}}　›</view></block></view></view>
